 "description": "Ontah2019 - Dynamic analysis of a tumor treatment model using oncolytic virus and chemotherapy with saturated infection rate\nBioModels BIOMD0000000877 (curated). SBML file: Ontah2019.xml.\nSimulation: 0 to 100 time units (SED-ML: Ontah2019.sedml), sampling 0.1.\nRun switches: -ig:mass -INT:1 -obeymaxint\nVerification against libRoadRunner (SBML reference): PASS, max |difference| = 4.10e-06 of species peak (worst: V)\nSBML time units are used unchanged as Kintecus seconds.\nConversion notes:\n  [info] Tumor_Cell_Infection: rate is not proportional to its reactants; divided form used with 1/(c+1e-30) so an empty species is not consumed",
